      "sourceTextSha256": "54223780d650ca9eb3dcfe66914e1e994531dd8f27c6731fda2730d7e7ec161a",
      "text": "Over 10 days, you’ll travel through four very different parts of Colombia: high-altitude Bogotá, green Medellín and the countryside around Guatapé, the coffee region around Pereira, and the Caribbean coast at Cartagena. The itinerary brings together colonial quarters, museums, pre-Columbian history, Lake Guatavita, the Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá, El Peñón de Guatapé, the Cocora Valley, a coffee plantation and Cartagena’s fortresses.",
